book:Chopping|chopped]]\n*2 pounds (900 g) baby [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]] (whole)\n*3 pounds (1350 g) brown [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] of [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n*18 pounds (8.1 kg) chicken broth\n*1 container Mrs Dash seasoning\n*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]] to taste\n*[[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]] optional\n\n==Procedure==\n#Cut the chicken into small pieces.\n#Fill the stock pot half full with water. Add the chicken and chicken broth in the large stock pot.  \n#Let [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] for about an hour, stirring frequently. \n#After an hour combine the rest of the ingredients and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] for 1 hour to 1 hour and 30 minutes, stirring frequently.  \n\n==Alternative recipes==\nPossible other veggies to add include:\n\n*2 pounds (900 g) [[Cookbook:Broccoli|broccoli]]\n*2 pounds (900 g) [[Cookbook:Cauliflower|cauliflower]]\n*2 pounds (900 g) [[Cookbook:Corn|corn]]\n\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken breast]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Chicken Brown Rice Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"5 pounds (2.3 kg) boneless chicken breast","sourceText":"5 pounds (2.3 kg) boneless chicken breast","amountText":"5 pounds (2.3 kg) boneless chicken breast","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 pounds (900 g) onions, diced","sourceText":"2 pounds (900 g) onions, diced","amountText":"2 pounds (900 g) onions, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 pounds (900 g) celery, chopped","sourceText":"2 pounds (900 g) celery, chopped","amountText":"2 pounds (900 g) celery, chopped","amount":null,"unit":nul